{"sha": "7ea362ddd73c6553ed70f92ba9b339e6add431b4844436707c630a1ebaf789e2", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "与数列情形的论证相同（见\\cref{thm:g12:seq:squeeze}）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[极限的计算方法]\\label{met:g12:limcont:limits}", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 多项式与有理函数在 $\\pm\\infty$ 处的极限：提出", "        $x$ 的最高次幂，", "        极限即为首项之比的极限。", "  \\item $\\frac{0}{0}$ 型：在点 $a$ 处，从分子与分母中提出因式 $(x-a)$，", "        或识别出一个导数", "        $\\lim_{x\\to a}\\frac{f(x)-f(a)}{x-a} = f'(a)$（见\\cref{ch:g12:deriv}）。", "  \\item 含平方根时：乘以共轭表达式。", "  \\item 振荡因子（$\\cos$、$\\sin$）：使用夹逼定理。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{连续性}", "", "\\begin{definition}[连续性]\\label{def:g12:limcont:continuity}", "设 $f$ 为定义在区间 $I$ 上的函数，$a \\in I$。称 $f$ 在", "$a$ 处\\emph{连续}\\index{连续}，是指 $\\lim\\limits_{x \\to a} f(x) = f(a)$。", "称该函数在 $I$ 上\\emph{连续}\\index{连续}，", "若该函数在 $I$ 的每一点处都连续。", "\\end{definition}", "", "直观上，区间上连续函数的图像", "可以不抬笔一笔画出。", "", "\\begin{proposition}[常见函数的连续性]\\label{prop:g12:limcont:usual}", "多项式、有理函数、$x \\mapsto \\sqrt{x}$、$x \\mapsto \\abs{x}$、", "$\\cos$、$\\sin$、$\\exp$ 与 $\\ln$ 在其定义域内所含的任一区间上连续。", "连续函数的和、积、商（在有定义处）及复合", "仍为连续函数。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}[部分证明]", "和、积、商及复合的稳定性由极限的相应定理得出。", "恒等映射 $x \\mapsto x$ 与常值函数的连续性", "可直接由定义得到，因此多项式与有理函数连续。", "其余常见函数的连续性在它们被构造的章节中证明，", "或在本阶段不加证明地承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}", "\\emph{取整函数} $x \\mapsto \\floor{x}$", "（即满足 $\\leq x$ 的最大整数）在任一整数 $n$ 处都不连续：", "其在该点的左极限为 $n - 1$，而 $\\floor{n} = n$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=7.2cm, height=5.6cm,", "  xmin=-1.9, xmax=3.5, ymin=-2.5, ymax=2.7,", "  xtick={-1,1,2,3}, ytick={-2,-1,1,2}]", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (axis cs:-1.5,-2) -- (axis cs:-1,-2);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (axis cs:-1,-1) -- (axis cs:0,-1);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (axis cs:0,0) -- (axis cs:1,0);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (axis cs:1,1) -- (axis cs:2,1);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (axis cs:2,2) -- (axis cs:3,2);", "  \\fill[omDef] (axis cs:-1,-1) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill[omDef] (axis cs:0,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill[omDef] (axis cs:1,1) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill[omDef] (axis cs:2,2) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[omDef, fill=white] (axis cs:-1,-2) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[omDef, fill=white] (axis cs:0,-1) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[omDef, fill=white] (axis cs:1,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[omDef, fill=white] (axis cs:2,1) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[omDef, fill=white] (axis cs:3,2) circle (1.5pt);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 取整函数在每个整数处都有跳跃：函数值（实心点）", "与左极限（空心点）不同。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[数列与连续性]\\label{prop:g12:limcont:seqcont}", "若 $u_n \\to \\ell$ 且 $f$ 在 $\\ell$ 处连续，则 $f(u_n) \\to f(\\ell)$。", "特别地，若由 $u_{n+1} = f(u_n)$ 所定义的数列收敛于", "$\\ell$，且 $f$ 在 $\\ell$ 处连续，则 $f(\\ell) = \\ell$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "第一个结论由对数列 $(u_n)$ 应用\\cref{thm:g12:limcont:composition}得出。", "对于第二个结论，在 $u_{n+1} = f(u_n)$ 两边取极限：", "左边趋于 $\\ell$，右边趋于 $f(\\ell)$，", "而极限是唯一的。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{介值定理}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[介值定理]\\label{thm:g12:limcont:ivt}", "\\index{介值定理}", "设 $f$ 在 $\\intcc{a}{b}$ 上连续，$k$ 为介于", "$f(a)$ 与 $f(b)$ 之间的任一数。则存在 $c \\in \\intcc{a}{b}$，使得", "$f(c) = k$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=8.8cm, height=6cm,", "  xmin=-0.4, xmax=4.4, ymin=-0.5, ymax=4.7,", "  xtick={0.5,3.19,3.8}, xticklabels={$a$,$c$,$b$},", "  ytick={1.26,2.5,3.98}, yticklabels={$f(a)$,$k$,$f(b)$}]", "  \\addplot[omProp, dashed, domain=0:3.19] {2.5};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0.5:3.8] {0.08*x^3 - 0.5*x + 1.5};", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:0.5,0) -- (axis cs:0.5,1.26)", "    -- (axis cs:0,1.26);", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:3.8,0) -- (axis cs:3.8,3.98)", "    -- (axis cs:0,3.98);", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:3.19,2.5) -- (axis cs:3.19,0);", "  \\fill (axis cs:0.5,1.26) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (axis cs:3.8,3.98) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (axis cs:3.19,2.5) circle (1.5pt);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}